<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Source: App.entitlements. The App Group shared with the widget extension (WidgetSyncPlugin writes, the widget reads). -->
